#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:4
msgid "View MaxFrame jobs with Logview"
msgstr "使用 Logview 查看 MaxFrame 作业"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:6
msgid ""
"Logview is a tool that records and displays the execution status of "
"MaxCompute jobs. It has been adapted for MaxFrame. This page describes how "
"to use Logview to inspect MaxFrame job execution information."
msgstr ""
"Logview 用于记录和展示 MaxCompute 作业的执行状态，也支持查看 MaxFrame 作业。本页介绍如何通过 Logview 查看 "
"MaxFrame 的作业执行信息。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:11
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:13
msgid ""
"Logview has been adapted for MaxFrame and supports the following "
"capabilities:"
msgstr "Logview 已适配 MaxFrame，支持以下能力："

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:16
msgid ""
"View execution records and elapsed time of all DAGs submitted from a "
"MaxFrame session."
msgstr "查看一个 MaxFrame session 中提交的所有 DAG 的执行记录和耗时。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:18
msgid ""
"Interactively view the execution order, runtime, operator topology, and "
"status relations of every Sub DAG inside a DAG."
msgstr "交互式查看一个 DAG 内各个 Sub DAG 的执行顺序、运行时间、算子拓扑和状态关系。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:20
msgid ""
"View the configuration, runtime status, memory and CPU resource usage of "
"each sub-instance."
msgstr "查看每个子实例的配置、运行状态，以及内存和 CPU 资源使用情况。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:23
msgid ""
"For general information about Logview, refer to `Use Logview 2.0 to view job"
" information <https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/maxcompute/use-"
"logview-v2-0-to-view-job-information>`_. This page focuses on viewing "
"MaxFrame job information."
msgstr ""
"Logview 的通用操作见 `使用 Logview 2.0 查看作业信息 <https://help.aliyun.com/zh/maxcompute"
"/user-guide/use-logview-v2-0-to-view-job-information>`_。本页主要介绍 MaxFrame "
"作业的信息。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:28
msgid "MaxFrame Logview entrance"
msgstr "MaxFrame Logview 入口"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:30
msgid ""
"Creating a session with ``session = new_session(...)`` generates a URL that "
"starts with ``https://logview.aliyun.com/logview``."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``session = new_session(...)`` 创建会话后，会生成以 "
"``https://logview.aliyun.com/logview`` 开头的链接。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:34
msgid ""
"For MaxFrame jobs submitted from DataWorks, click the URL directly to open "
"the MaxFrame Logview UI."
msgstr "从 DataWorks 提交 MaxFrame 作业时，可以直接点击链接，打开 MaxFrame Logview 页面。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:36
msgid ""
"For MaxFrame jobs submitted from a local environment, call "
"``session.get_logview_address()`` to print the URL, then copy it into a "
"browser."
msgstr "从本地环境提交 MaxFrame 作业时，调用 ``session.get_logview_address()`` 打印链接，再复制到浏览器打开。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:40
msgid ""
"The page has a title and feature area at the top, **Basic Info** on the "
"left, and a **DAG List** on the right. Open a DAG's **Detail** entry to "
"inspect its Sub DAGs."
msgstr ""
"页面顶部是标题和功能区，左侧是 **Basic Info**，右侧是 **DAG List**。点击某个 DAG 的 **Detail** "
"入口，可以查看它的 Sub DAG。"

