msgstr "开启或关闭自动刷新。开启后，页面每 10 秒刷新一次。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:86
msgid "DAG list"
msgstr "DAG 列表"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:88
msgid ""
"The DAG list is sorted by the order in which ``execute()`` was called, in "
"descending order. The most recently submitted job appears first. The columns"
" are described below."
msgstr "DAG 列表按照 ``execute()`` 调用顺序倒序排列，最新提交的作业显示在最前面。各列说明如下。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
