msgstr "DAG 完成时间。如果 DAG 仍在运行，则为空。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "Duration"
msgstr "Duration"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid ""
"DAG runtime, calculated from Start Time to End Time (or to the current time "
"if still running)."
msgstr "DAG 运行耗时，按 Start Time 到 End Time 计算；如果仍在运行，则计算到当前时间。"

