msgstr ""
"Sub DAG 的基本信息。见 `Basic Info <https://help.aliyun.com/zh/maxcompute/user-"
"guide/use-logview-v2-0-to-view-job-information#section-cpk-fnd-egg>`_。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:128
msgid "Sub DAG Graph"
msgstr "Sub DAG 图"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:130
msgid "The Sub DAG Graph shows the structure of the current DAG."
msgstr "Sub DAG 图展示当前 DAG 的结构。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "Current Sub DAG ID. Click it to return to the DAG list page."
msgstr "当前 Sub DAG ID。单击后返回 DAG 列表页。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "Breadcrumb navigation. Use it to switch between Sub DAG levels."
msgstr "面包屑导航。用于在 Sub DAG 层级之间切换。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid ""
"Diagnostic helpers, including Progress Chart, Input Heat Chart, Output Heat "
"Chart, TaskTime Heat Chart and InstanceTime Heat Chart."
msgstr ""
"诊断辅助工具，包括 Progress Chart、Input Heat Chart、Output Heat Chart、TaskTime Heat "
"Chart 和 InstanceTime Heat Chart。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid ""
"Refresh job execution status, switch to full screen or zoom the execution "
"graph, open MaxCompute Studio docs, and switch to the parent task level."
msgstr "刷新作业执行状态、切换全屏或缩放执行图、打开 MaxCompute Studio 文档，以及切换到父任务层级。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "⑤"
msgstr "⑤"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "Zoom helpers."
msgstr "缩放辅助工具。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "⑥"
msgstr "⑥"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "Table node. Represents an ODPS table."
msgstr "Table 节点，表示 ODPS 表。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "⑦"
msgstr "⑦"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "Sub DAG node. See *Sub DAG node fields* below."
msgstr "Sub DAG 节点。参见下方 *Sub DAG node fields*。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "⑧"
msgstr "⑧"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid ""
"Data flow. Represents data movement between STAGEs or between a STAGE and a "
"table."
msgstr "Data flow，表示 STAGE 之间或 STAGE 与表之间的数据流转。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "⑨"
msgstr "⑨"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "Canvas overview pane."
msgstr "画布概览面板。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:145
msgid "**Sub DAG node fields**"
msgstr "**Sub DAG 节点字段**"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:147
msgid ""
"``STAGE_X``: Sub DAG name. The number indicates execution order, starting "
"from 1 and increasing."
msgstr "``STAGE_X``：Sub DAG 名称。数字表示执行顺序，从 1 开始递增。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:149
msgid ""
"``X/X/X`` (for example ``0/5/5``): Number of ODPS instances in different "
"states inside the current Sub DAG, in the order *running / completed / "
"total*."
msgstr ""
"``X/X/X`` （例如 ``0/5/5``）：当前 Sub DAG 中不同状态的 ODPS instance 数量，顺序为 *running / "
"completed / total*。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:152
msgid "Start and end time."
msgstr "开始和结束时间。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:153
msgid "``MCSQL``: Engine that executes the current Sub DAG."
msgstr "``MCSQL``：执行当前 Sub DAG 的引擎。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:154
msgid ""
"``OP 1``: Number of operators contained in the current Sub DAG. Double-click"
" the node to view the operator graph."
msgstr "``OP 1``：当前 Sub DAG 包含的 operator 数量。双击节点可查看 operator graph。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:160
msgid "Sub DAG list"
msgstr "Sub DAG 列表"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:162
msgid ""
"This list shows the runtime information of all Sub DAGs in the current DAG, "
"sorted by time."
msgstr "该列表按时间顺序展示当前 DAG 中所有 Sub DAG 的运行信息。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "Sub DAG"
msgstr "Sub DAG"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "Name of the current Sub DAG."
msgstr "当前 Sub DAG 的名称。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "Failed/Terminated/ALL"
msgstr "Failed/Terminated/ALL"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid ""
"Number of ODPS instances in different states inside the current Sub DAG. "
"``(+X Fallback)`` means X instances were downgraded from MCQA to Offline SQL"
" — the data is not corrupted."
msgstr ""
"当前 Sub DAG 中不同状态的 ODPS instance 数量。``(+X Fallback)`` 表示 X 个 instance 从 MCQA "
"降级到 Offline SQL，数据不会损坏。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "Sub DAG status: Failed / Cancelled / Running / Succeeded."
msgstr "Sub DAG 状态：Failed / Cancelled / Running / Succeeded。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "Progress"
msgstr "Progress"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Sub DAG progress. Reaching 100% in the Running state only means all "
"instances scheduled so far have finished, not that the Sub DAG itself is "
"complete."
msgstr "Sub DAG 进度。在 Running 状态下达到 100% 只表示当前已调度的所有 instance 已完成，并不表示 Sub DAG 本身已经完成。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "Sub DAG submission time."
msgstr "Sub DAG 提交时间。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "Sub DAG completion time."
msgstr "Sub DAG 完成时间。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "Sub DAG runtime."
msgstr "Sub DAG 运行耗时。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "Timeline"
msgstr "Timeline"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "Timeline preview that shows the start order and time consumption."
msgstr "Timeline 预览，用于展示开始顺序和耗时。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:180
msgid "Instance list"
msgstr "Instance 列表"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:182
msgid ""
"For MCSQL, this list contains the ODPS SQL jobs related to the Sub DAG. Open"
" the relevant job with its **Detail** icon. In that job's Logview, select "
"the task under **Fuxi Jobs** and open **StdOut** or **StdErr** in **Fuxi "
"Instance of Fuxi Task**. **StdOut** shows text printed by the UDF, and "
"**StdErr** shows errors and warnings."
msgstr ""
"对于 MCSQL，该列表展示与 Sub DAG 相关的 ODPS SQL 作业。点击对应作业的 **Detail** 图标，在打开的 Logview "
"中，从 **Fuxi Jobs** 选择任务，再从 **Fuxi Instance of Fuxi Task** 列表打开 **StdOut** 或 "
"**StdErr**。**StdOut** 显示 UDF 打印的信息，**StdErr** 可用来查看错误和警告。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:188
msgid "SQL instance Detail entry highlighted in the user Logview"
msgstr "用户版 Logview 的 SQL 实例，红框标出了 Detail 入口"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:188
msgid ".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/udf/mcsql-subdag-entry.jpg"
msgstr ""
".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/udf/mcsql-subdag-entry.jpg\n"
"   :alt: 用户版 Logview 的 SQL 实例，红框标出了 Detail 入口"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:192
msgid ""
"For DPE, find the ``DPE SubDAG instance`` row in **Instance of Sub DAG** and"
" click its **Detail** icon. This opens the DPE details in a new tab. Select "
"the Step containing the UDF, then open **StdOut** or **StdErr** on the "
"relevant row in its **SubSteps** list."
msgstr ""
"DPE 作业需要在 **Instance of Sub DAG** 中找到 ``DPE SubDAG instance``，点击该行的 "
"**Detail** 图标。新标签页会打开 DPE 详情，选择包含 UDF 的 Step，再从 **SubSteps** 列表中找到对应任务，打开该行的"
" **StdOut** 或 **StdErr**。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:197
msgid "DPE SubDAG instance Detail entry highlighted in the user Logview"
msgstr "用户版 Logview 的 DPE SubDAG 实例，红框标出了 Detail 入口"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:197
msgid ".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/udf/dpe-subdag-entry.jpg"
msgstr ""
".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/udf/dpe-subdag-entry.jpg\n"
"   :alt: 用户版 Logview 的 DPE SubDAG 实例，红框标出了 Detail 入口"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:201
msgid "For both paths with screenshots, see :ref:`udf_debugging`."
msgstr "两条路径的完整操作和截图见 :ref:`udf_debugging`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "Instance ID"
msgstr "Instance ID"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "ID of the ODPS instance job."
msgstr "ODPS instance job 的 ID。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "Instance status. See *Instance status values* below."
msgstr "Instance 状态。参见下方 *Instance status values*。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "Job details."
msgstr "作业详情。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "Job submission time."
msgstr "作业提交时间。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "Job completion time."
msgstr "作业完成时间。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:1
msgid "Job runtime."
msgstr "作业运行耗时。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:214
msgid "**Instance status values**"
msgstr "**Instance 状态值说明**"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:216
msgid "**Failed**: Execution failed."
msgstr "**Failed**：执行失败。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:217
msgid "**Cancelled**: The job was cancelled."
msgstr "**Cancelled**：作业已取消。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:218
msgid "**Running**: The job is running."
msgstr "**Running**：作业正在运行。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:219
msgid "**Terminated**: The job finished successfully."
msgstr "**Terminated**：作业已成功完成。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:220
msgid "**Fallback**: The job was downgraded; a new instance record will be created."
msgstr "**Fallback**：作业发生降级，会创建一条新的 instance 记录。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:222
msgid ""
"**Unknown_terminated**: The job has finished, but it is not known whether it"
" succeeded or failed."
msgstr "**Unknown_terminated**：作业已结束，但无法确定是成功还是失败。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:228
msgid "Fuxi Sensor"
msgstr "Fuxi Sensor"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:230
msgid ""
"Fuxi Sensor shows actual CPU and memory use for Fuxi instances. In the SQL "
"job's Logview, open the relevant task under **Fuxi Jobs**, then its worker's"
" **Sensor** entry. Availability depends on the region and runtime."
msgstr ""
"Fuxi Sensor 展示 Fuxi Instance 的实际 CPU 和内存用量。在 SQL 作业的 Logview 中，从 **Fuxi "
"Jobs** 找到对应任务，再打开 Worker 所在行的 **Sensor**。该功能是否可用，取决于地域和运行环境。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:234
msgid ""
"DPE uses a separate **SubSteps** view. Open **Sensor** on the UDF task's "
"row; see :ref:`udf_debugging_dpe`. Its **Resource Basic Metrics** section "
"shows ``mem_plan`` and ``mem_usage``; **Mem Metrics** separates RSS and page"
" cache. Check the task ID and time range to identify the attempt being "
"measured. An elastic-memory allocation label does not report measured usage."
" A sample from the DPE user Logview is shown in "
":ref:`udf_elastic_memory_observation`."
msgstr ""
"DPE 使用单独的 **SubSteps** 页面。打开 UDF 任务所在行的 **Sensor**，具体路径见 "
":ref:`udf_debugging_dpe`。其中 **Resource Basic Metrics** 显示 ``mem_plan`` 和 "
"``mem_usage``，**Mem Metrics** 将 RSS 和 page cache 分开显示。需要核对任务 ID "
"和时间范围，确认曲线对应哪次尝试。弹性内存标签表示分配比例，不代表实际用量。用户版 DPE Logview 的实测示例见 "
":ref:`udf_elastic_memory_observation`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:241
msgid "Use the charts to:"
msgstr "这些图表可以用于："

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:243
msgid "Determine the actual amount of memory used when a job runs out of memory."
msgstr "确认作业发生 OOM 时实际使用了多少内存。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:245
msgid "Inspect the resource usage of MaxFrame Fuxi instances:"
msgstr "查看 MaxFrame Fuxi instance 的资源使用情况："

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:247
msgid "**CPU usage**"
msgstr "**CPU 使用率**"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:249
msgid ""
"The CPU chart contains two lines: one shows the requested CPU "
"(``cpu_plan``), the other shows the actual CPU usage (``cpu_usage``). On the"
" y-axis, ``400`` means 4 processors. The requested CPU can be adjusted only "
"by changing the number of processors. The actual CPU usage cannot be tuned "
"directly."
msgstr ""
"CPU 图表包含两条线：一条表示申请的 CPU（``cpu_plan``），另一条表示实际 CPU 使用量（``cpu_usage``）。在 y "
"轴上，``400`` 表示 4 个 processor。申请的 CPU 只能通过调整 processor 数量改变，实际 CPU 使用量无法直接调节。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:255
msgid "**Memory usage**"
msgstr "**内存使用量**"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:257
msgid ""
"The memory chart contains two lines: requested memory (``mem_plan``) and "
"actual memory usage (``mem_usage``)."
msgstr "内存图表包含两条线：申请内存（``mem_plan``）和实际内存使用量（``mem_usage``）。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:261
msgid "Use cases"
msgstr "使用场景"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:264
msgid "View the longest-running stage"
msgstr "查看耗时最长的 stage"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:266
msgid ""
"The DAG list, Sub DAG list, and Instance list each have a **Timeline** "
"column. Use it to compare execution times and find the longest-running entry"
" at that level."
msgstr "DAG 列表、Sub DAG 列表和 Instance 列表都有 **Timeline** 列，可用于比较执行耗时，找到当前层级中运行时间最长的记录。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:272
msgid ""
"Sorting **Duration** in descending order places the longest-running entries "
"first, including when the list spans multiple pages."
msgstr "按 **Duration** 降序排列后，耗时最长的条目会排在前面；列表有多页时同样有效。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:276
msgid "View the cause of an execution failure"
msgstr "查看执行失败原因"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:278
msgid ""
"When a DAG fails or the client returns an exception, follow these steps in "
"MaxFrame Logview:"
msgstr "当 DAG 执行失败或客户端返回异常时，可以在 MaxFrame Logview 中按以下步骤排查："

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:281
msgid "Check the status of every DAG in the DAG list."
msgstr "在 DAG 列表中查看每个 DAG 的状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:282
msgid ""
"Find the most recent DAG with status ``Failed`` and click the icon in the "
"**Detail** column to view the details."
msgstr "找到最近一个状态为 ``Failed`` 的 DAG，单击 **Detail** 列中的图标查看详情。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:284
msgid ""
"On the DAG details page, find the Sub DAG node displayed in red (for example"
" ``STAGE_1``). The **Result** page also shows the error message."
msgstr "在 DAG 详情页中找到显示为红色的 Sub DAG 节点（例如 ``STAGE_1``）。**Result** 页面也会展示错误信息。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:286
msgid ""
"Click the failed Sub DAG node ``STAGE_1``. In the Instance list, click the "
"icon in the **Detail** column to find the failed instance."
msgstr ""
"单击失败的 Sub DAG 节点 ``STAGE_1``。在 Instance 列表中，单击 **Detail** 列中的图标，定位失败的 "
"instance。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:290
msgid "View operators contained in a Sub DAG"
msgstr "查看 Sub DAG 中包含的 operators"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:292
msgid "There are two ways to view the operators contained in a Sub DAG:"
msgstr "可以通过以下两种方式查看 Sub DAG 中包含的 operators："

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:294
msgid "**Method 1**: On the DAG details page, click the Sub DAG node."
msgstr "**方式 1**：在 DAG 详情页中，单击 Sub DAG 节点。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:295
msgid "**Method 2**: On the DAG details page, double-click the Sub DAG node."
msgstr "**方式 2**：在 DAG 详情页中，双击 Sub DAG 节点。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:299
msgid ""
"Each operator is annotated with the line of MaxFrame script code it "
"corresponds to."
msgstr "每个 operator 都会标注其对应的 MaxFrame 脚本代码行。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:301
msgid ""
"Some operators are tagged with ``merged from``. This means the optimizer "
"merged multiple operators after DAG submission to produce a new operator "
"with the same functionality but better performance."
msgstr ""
"部分 operators 会带有 ``merged from`` 标记，表示优化器在 DAG 提交后合并了多个 "
"operators，生成了功能相同但性能更好的新 operator。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:306
msgid "View table data"
msgstr "查看表数据"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:308
msgid "**View the data flow structure**"
msgstr "**查看数据流结构**"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:310
msgid ""
"To inspect the data flow, double-click a Sub DAG node on the DAG details "
"page to enter the operator details page. Click the connection line between "
"two operators to view the data type, index, and column name information."
msgstr ""
"如需查看数据流，在 DAG 详情页中双击某个 Sub DAG 节点进入 operator 详情页。单击两个 operators "
"之间的连线，即可查看数据类型、index 和 column name 信息。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:315
msgid "The fields are described below:"
msgstr "字段说明如下："

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:317
msgid "``Type: dataframe``: The upstream operator outputs a ``dataframe``."
msgstr "``Type: dataframe``：上游 operator 输出 ``dataframe``。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:318
msgid "``DataFrame Index``: Index information."
msgstr "``DataFrame Index``：Index 信息。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:320
msgid ""
"``None: int64`` means the DataFrame contains a single unnamed index of type "
"``int64``."
msgstr "``None: int64`` 表示该 DataFrame 包含一个未命名、类型为 ``int64`` 的单级 index。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:322
msgid "``DataFrame Columns``: Column information."
msgstr "``DataFrame Columns``：Column 信息。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:324
msgid ""
"``<column name>: <dtype>`` lists every column in the current DataFrame with "
"its data type."
msgstr "``<column name>: <dtype>`` 列出当前 DataFrame 中每个 column 及其数据类型。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:326
msgid "``DataFrame Level Names``: The level names of the current DataFrame."
msgstr "``DataFrame Level Names``：当前 DataFrame 的 level names。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:328
msgid "**View the data table structure**"
msgstr "**查看数据表结构**"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:330
msgid ""
"Click any operator graph or any ODPS Table node in the Sub DAG Graph to view"
" the table structure."
msgstr "在 Sub DAG Graph 中单击任意 operator graph 或 ODPS Table 节点，即可查看表结构。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:334
msgid "View job details"
msgstr "查看作业详情"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/general/logview.rst:336
msgid ""
"On the DAG details page, click the icon in the **Detail** column of the "
"Instance list to view the job details."
msgstr "在 DAG 详情页中，单击 Instance 列表 **Detail** 列中的图标，即可查看作业详情。"
